<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables -  GTW.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables -  GTW.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Thursday that Ikon Office Solutions Inc, CPC International Inc and Gateway 2000 Inc were unavailable for after-hours trading, with news pending.</p>
<p>The exchange also said Buenos Aires Embotelladora, Corimon SACA and Edison Brothers Stores Inc were unavailable for after-hours trading.</p>
